  targetType: 0100000005000000
  description: "Void Resonators emerged from forbidden research into spatial instability
    and energy resonance. Initial experiments resulted in unexplained disappearances
    and data corruption. The project was officially terminated\u2014then quietly
    revived under military authority. Each Resonator still operates on theories that
    are not fully understood."
  vnDescription: "Void Resonators ra \u0111\u1EDDi t\u1EEB nh\u1EEFng nghi\xEAn c\u1EE9u
    b\u1ECB c\u1EA5m v\u1EC1 s\u1EF1 b\u1EA5t \u1ED5n kh\xF4ng gian v\xE0 c\u1ED9ng
    h\u01B0\u1EDFng n\u0103ng l\u01B0\u1EE3ng. C\xE1c th\xED nghi\u1EC7m ban \u0111\u1EA7u
    d\u1EABn \u0111\u1EBFn nh\u1EEFng v\u1EE5 m\u1EA5t t\xEDch kh\xF4ng r\xF5 nguy\xEAn
    nh\xE2n v\xE0 s\u1EF1 ph\xE1 v\u1EE1 d\u1EEF li\u1EC7u. D\u1EF1 \xE1n \u0111\xE3
    ch\xEDnh th\u1EE9c b\u1ECB ch\u1EA5m d\u1EE9t\u2014sau \u0111\xF3 \u0111\u01B0\u1EE3c
    \xE2m th\u1EA7m kh\xF4i ph\u1EE5c d\u01B0\u1EDBi s\u1EF1 ch\u1EC9 \u0111\u1EA1o
    c\u1EE7a qu\xE2n \u0111\u1ED9i. M\u1ED7i thi\u1EBFt b\u1ECB c\u1ED9ng h\u01B0\u1EDFng
    v\u1EABn ho\u1EA1t \u0111\u1ED9ng d\u1EF1a tr\xEAn nh\u1EEFng l\xFD thuy\u1EBFt
    ch\u01B0a \u0111\u01B0\u1EE3c hi\u1EC3u r\xF5 ho\xE0n to\xE0n."
